 - valkyrien skies (with VS 2.4.x installed)
    - attach hook to a stationary ship block
    - attach hook to a moving ship; check hook follows the ship
    - swing from a hook attached to a moving ship
    - hooked ship flies away: check rope pays out to max length, then snaps
    - rope wraps around a ship hull corner; check bend follows the ship as it moves
    - rope unwraps when swinging back around a ship corner
    - hooked to a ship, walk/swing around a pillar or wall corner: the rope wraps it every time, with the ship
      still, drifting toward you, away from you, sideways, bobbing and turning (same as a hook on a block)
    - hooked to a light ship, walk away round a pillar so the rope drags the ship: the rope stays wrapped and
      the ship is pulled towards the pillar first
    - with the rope already wrapped once, let the ship carry the hook end over another corner: it wraps that too
    - walk far past a thin (1-block) pillar after wrapping it: the rope stays wrapped until you walk back
    - a ship moving into a still rope (hook on a block) catches it and pushes it along
    - hook attached to ship, ship deleted (kill command / disassembly): check hook detaches within a few seconds
    - hook attached to ship, walk far away so ship unloads: check hook detaches
    - break the ship block the hook is attached to: check rope detaches
    - throw hook at a rotated ship: check hook lands and sits flush on the hull
    - wallrun along a ship hull
    - magnet hook near a ship
    - check everything above on a dedicated server
    - check the mod works normally with VS NOT installed (client and dedicated server)
